      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. can u go into more detail for the part about the regressive/stubborn side? i want to make sure the kids really get why those views are often pushed back against in modern society. like, how should i frame the \"stubborn\" arguments so they understand why they're seen as holding back progress?",
